										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>我們以精益求精的態度,嚴格要求對產品品質的管制,不斷追蹤、檢討與改善,滿足 不同客戶之需求。 因為我們相信:唯有優質的產品,才能真正獲得客戶的青睞,這一直是我們努力不懈 的目標準!</p>



<p>We strive for perfection. We strictly demand the quality and continuously track, review and improve to meeting customers needs. We firmly believe that only best quality can earn customer&#8217;s trust.</p>
